{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 155,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        66.95471954345703,
        238.00807189941406,
        82.6147232055664
      ],
      "text": "Patients with extensive disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        89.82263946533203,
        527.6157836914062,
        104.26564025878906
      ],
      "text": "Although the IPD analysis did not provide evidence for duration of treatment extension, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        103.02259063720703,
        527.4266357421875,
        117.46559143066406
      ],
      "text": "prolongation of the 6(H)REZ–levofloxacin regimen to more than 6 months could be considered on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        114.94672393798828,
        527.4237060546875,
        130.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "(108) an individual basis for patients with extensive disease  . Prolongation of treatment may increase",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        277.92181396484375,
        129.312744140625,
        433.36279296875,
        143.66773986816406
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.42274475097656,
        438.9535827636719,
        143.86573791503906
      ],
      "text": "the risk of adverse events in some cases (see  ).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        160.26649475097656,
        190.875732421875,
        175.92648315429688
      ],
      "text": "People living with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        183.13453674316406,
        527.4310913085938,
        197.57752990722656
      ],
      "text": "The effect of longer duration TB treatment among PLHIV with and without ART has been studied",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        195.0585479736328,
        527.4139404296875,
        210.7775421142578
      ],
      "text": "(109) among patients with drug-susceptible TB  . In these cases, relapse has been reported to be 2.4",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        209.53443908691406,
        527.544677734375,
        223.97743225097656
      ],
      "text": "times higher in PLHIV who were not on ART and who received 6 months of treatment than in patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.986041069030762,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        222.7344512939453,
        527.4638061523438,
        237.1774444580078
      ],
      "text": "in whom treatment was prolonged (up to 9 months). In patients with drug-susceptible TB initiated on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993098258972168,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        235.9344024658203,
        527.1865844726562,
        250.3773956298828
      ],
      "text": "ART, no significant benefit from prolonging rifampicin-containing regimens for over 6 months has been",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.948478698730469,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        247.85841369628906,
        527.3983764648438,
        263.5774230957031
      ],
      "text": "(93) observed  . In the current analysis, only a limited number of patients received ART; nonetheless,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        262.33441162109375,
        527.4520874023438,
        276.7774353027344
      ],
      "text": "in TB patients with HIV coinfection, the first priority is to ensure that they are started on ART within",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        274.2584228515625,
        527.4054565429688,
        289.9774475097656
      ],
      "text": "(110) 8 weeks of TB treatment initiation (regardless of CD4 count), in accordance with WHO guidelines  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.970359802246094,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        288.73443603515625,
        394.68194580078125,
        303.1774597167969
      ],
      "text": "The 6(H)REZ–levofloxacin regimen is therefore recommended in PLHIV.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        319.57830810546875,
        200.59568786621094,
        335.2383117675781
      ],
      "text": "Extrapulmonary disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        342.4461975097656,
        527.4278564453125,
        356.88922119140625
      ],
      "text": "No data were available for patients with exclusive extrapulmonary Hr-TB. The regimen composition",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        355.6462097167969,
        527.5431518554688,
        370.0892333984375
      ],
      "text": "proposed is likely to be effective even in these patients. However, the treatment of patients with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        368.84619140625,
        527.232666015625,
        383.2892150878906
      ],
      "text": "extrapulmonary TB should be designed in close consultation with appropriate specialists (e.g. infectious",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.948027610778809,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        382.04620361328125,
        527.3992309570312,
        396.4892272949219
      ],
      "text": "disease physicians and neurologists), to decide upon individual variations in treatment duration and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.2462158203125,
        197.46949768066406,
        409.6892395019531
      ],
      "text": "supportive care, as needed.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.06341552734375,
        245.23455810546875,
        438.9154052734375
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        455.2633056640625,
        149.77810668945312,
        470.9233093261719
      ],
      "text": "Case scenarios",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        478.1313171386719,
        527.4861450195312,
        492.5743408203125
      ],
      "text": "Implementing these recommendations requires the (H)REZ–levofloxacin regimen to be administered",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999699592590332,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        491.3312072753906,
        527.4322509765625,
        505.77423095703125
      ],
      "text": "only in patients in whom resistance to isoniazid has been confirmed and resistance to rifampicin has",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        504.53125,
        527.5601806640625,
        518.9742431640625
      ],
      "text": "been excluded. Preferably, testing for resistance to fluoroquinolones (and, if possible, to pyrazinamide)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.965044021606445,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        517.7313232421875,
        527.3836059570312,
        532.17431640625
      ],
      "text": "is also done before starting treatment. It is envisaged that the treatment regimen for Hr-TB will apply",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        530.9312133789062,
        189.787109375,
        545.3742065429688
      ],
      "text": "in the following situations:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        551.3591918945312,
        441.38671875,
        567.023193359375
      ],
      "text": "Hr-TB and rifampicin susceptibility are confirmed before TB treatment is started.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        552.6351928710938,
        78.23609924316406,
        567.0781860351562
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        441.0174865722656,
        552.6351928710938,
        524.4129028320312,
        567.0781860351562
      ],
      "text": "Treatment with (H)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        565.835205078125,
        527.5838623046875,
        580.2781982421875
      ],
      "text": "REZ–levofloxacin is started immediately. If the diagnosis is strongly presumed (e.g. close contacts of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.976574897766113,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        579.0352172851562,
        527.1718139648438,
        593.4782104492188
      ],
      "text": "a confirmed Hr-TB source case) but results of DST are still pending, the regimen may be introduced.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.969006538391113,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        592.2352294921875,
        527.3761596679688,
        606.67822265625
      ],
      "text": "If the DST results taken at the start eventually show susceptibility to isoniazid, then levofloxacin is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        605.4351806640625,
        458.2245788574219,
        619.878173828125
      ],
      "text": "stopped, and the patient continues treatment to complete a 2HREZ/4HR regimen.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        617.3591918945312,
        428.1702880859375,
        633.023193359375
      ],
      "text": "Hr-TB is confirmed after the start of treatment with the 2HREZ/4HR regimen.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        618.6351928710938,
        78.23609924316406,
        633.0781860351562
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        427.8125,
        618.6351928710938,
        527.4176025390625,
        633.0781860351562
      ],
      "text": "This includes patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        631.835205078125,
        527.5587158203125,
        646.2781982421875
      ],
      "text": "who had undiagnosed isoniazid resistance initially or who developed isoniazid resistance later while",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.969758987426758,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        645.0352172851562,
        527.1715087890625,
        659.4782104492188
      ],
      "text": "on treatment with a first-line regimen. In such cases, rapid molecular testing for rifampicin resistance",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.9617338180542,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        658.2352294921875,
        527.3716430664062,
        672.67822265625
      ],
      "text": "must be done (or repeated). Once rifampicin resistance has been excluded, a full 6-month course of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.9606294631958,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        671.4351806640625,
        527.4159545898438,
        685.878173828125
      ],
      "text": "(H)REZ–levofloxacin is given. The duration is driven by the need to give levofloxacin for 6 months,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        684.6351928710938,
        497.95013427734375,
        699.0781860351562
      ],
      "text": "which usually implies that the companion first-line medicines are taken for longer than this.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        706.339111328125,
        527.2904663085938,
        720.7821044921875
      ],
      "text": "If rifampicin resistance is detected, the patient needs to be started on a recommended MDR-TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        719.5391235351562,
        388.6253662109375,
        733.9821166992188
      ],
      "text": "treatment regimen, as described in other sections of these guidelines.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        330.23760986328125,
        801.0170288085938,
        556.099609375,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 2 Drug-resistant TB treatment: Recommendations  141",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}